{"text":"kuruntokai","n":68,"lines":["பூழ்க்கா லன்ன செங்கால் உழுந்தின்","ஊழ்ப்படு முதுகாய் உழையினங் கவரும்","அரும்பனி அற்சிரந் தீர்க்கும்","மருந்துபிறி தில்லையவர் மணந்த மார்பே"],"tr":["pūḻkkā laṉṉa ceṅkāl uḻuntiṉ","ūḻppaṭu mutukāy uḻaiyiṉaṅ kavarum","arumpaṉi aṟciran tīrkkum","maruntupiṟi tillaiyavar maṇanta mārpē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"kuṟiñci","tinai_ta":"குறிஞ்சி","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"அள்ளூர் நன்முல்லையார்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Aḷḷūr Naṉmullaiyār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"4 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"3×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 13, veṇcīr 1, vañcicīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"veṇṭaḷai 7, āciriyattaḷai 6, oṉṟiya vañcittaḷai 1"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"பூழ்க்கா","tr":"pūḻkkā","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பூழ்க்","tr":"pūḻk"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"}]},{"text":"லன்ன","tr":"laṉṉa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"லன்","tr":"laṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ன","tr":"ṉa"}]},{"text":"செங்கால்","tr":"ceṅkāl","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"செங்","tr":"ceṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கால்","tr":"kāl"}]},{"text":"உழுந்தின்","tr":"uḻuntiṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"உழுந்","tr":"uḻun"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தின்","tr":"tiṉ"}]}],[{"text":"ஊழ்ப்படு","tr":"ūḻppaṭu","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஊழ்ப்","tr":"ūḻp"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"படு","tr":"paṭu"}]},{"text":"முதுகாய்","tr":"mutukāy","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"முது","tr":"mutu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"காய்","tr":"kāy"}]},{"text":"உழையினங்","tr":"uḻaiyiṉaṅ","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"உழை","tr":"uḻai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யினங்","tr":"yiṉaṅ"}]},{"text":"கவரும்","tr":"kavarum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கவ","tr":"kava"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரும்","tr":"rum"}]}],[{"text":"அரும்பனி","tr":"arumpaṉi","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அரும்","tr":"arum"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பனி","tr":"paṉi"}]},{"text":"அற்சிரந்","tr":"aṟciran","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"அற்","tr":"aṟ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"சிரந்","tr":"ciran"}]},{"text":"தீர்க்கும்","tr":"tīrkkum","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தீர்க்","tr":"tīrk"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கும்","tr":"kum"}]}],[{"text":"மருந்துபிறி","tr":"maruntupiṟi","foot":"karuviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மருந்","tr":"marun"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"துபி","tr":"tupi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றி","tr":"ṟi"}]},{"text":"தில்லையவர்","tr":"tillaiyavar","foot":"tēmāṅkaṉi","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தில்","tr":"til"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லை","tr":"lai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யவர்","tr":"yavar"}]},{"text":"மணந்த","tr":"maṇanta","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மணந்","tr":"maṇan"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"மார்பே","tr":"mārpē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மார்","tr":"mār"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பே","tr":"pē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"பூழ்க்கால்","parts":[{"text":"பூழ்","lemma":"பூழ்","gloss":"quail"},{"text":"கால்","lemma":"கால்","gloss":"leg"}],"gloss":"quail's leg"},{"surface":"அன்ன","parts":[{"text":"அன்ன","lemma":"அன்ன","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"},{"surface":"செங்கால்","parts":[{"text":"செம்","lemma":"செம்மை","gloss":"red"},{"text":"கால்","lemma":"கால்","gloss":"stem"}],"gloss":"red stem"},{"surface":"உழுந்தின்","parts":[{"text":"உழுந்து","lemma":"உழுந்து","gloss":"black gram"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of black gram"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஊழ்ப்படு","parts":[{"text":"ஊழ்","lemma":"ஊழ்","gloss":"ripeness"},{"text":"படு","lemma":"படு","gloss":"happen"}],"gloss":"ripened"},{"surface":"முதுகாய்","parts":[{"text":"முது","lemma":"முதுமை","gloss":"mature"},{"text":"காய்","lemma":"காய்","gloss":"pod"}],"gloss":"mature pod"},{"surface":"உழையினம்","parts":[{"text":"உழை","lemma":"உழை","gloss":"deer"},{"text":"இனம்","lemma":"இனம்","gloss":"herd"}],"gloss":"herd of deer"},{"surface":"கவரும்","parts":[{"text":"கவர்","lemma":"கவர்","gloss":"seize/eat"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"which eats"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அரும்பனி","parts":[{"text":"அரும்பனி","lemma":"அரும்பனி","gloss":"harsh cold"}],"gloss":"harsh cold","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"அற்சிரம்","parts":[{"text":"அற்சிரம்","lemma":"அற்சிரம்","gloss":"early winter season"}],"gloss":"early winter season"},{"surface":"தீர்க்கும்","parts":[{"text":"தீர்க்கும்","lemma":"தீர்க்கும்","gloss":"which cures"}],"gloss":"which cures"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மருந்து","parts":[{"text":"மருந்து","lemma":"மருந்து","gloss":"medicine"}],"gloss":"medicine"},{"surface":"பிறிது","parts":[{"text":"பிறிது","lemma":"பிறிது","gloss":"other"}],"gloss":"other"},{"surface":"இல்லை","parts":[{"text":"இல்லை","lemma":"இல்லை","gloss":"is not"}],"gloss":"is not"},{"surface":"அவர்","parts":[{"text":"அவர்","lemma":"அவர்","gloss":"he"}],"gloss":"he"},{"surface":"மணந்த","parts":[{"text":"மணந்த","lemma":"மணந்த","gloss":"embraced"}],"gloss":"embraced"},{"surface":"மார்பே","parts":[{"text":"மார்பு","lemma":"மார்பு","gloss":"chest"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"chest indeed"}]}],"literal":"Like the leg of a quail, the red-stemmed black gram's / ripened mature pods, the herd of deer consumes, in this / harsh cold early winter season, to cure [the chill], / other medicine there is none, except his embraced chest indeed.","translation":"To cure the harsh cold of this early winter season, when herds of deer feed on the mature, ripened pods of the red-stemmed black gram that look like the legs of quails, there is no other medicine than his chest that once embraced me.","modern":"காடைப் பறவையின் காலைப் போன்ற சிவந்த தண்டுடைய உளுந்தின் முற்றிய நெற்றுகளை மான்கூட்டம் கவராநிற்கும் அரிய பனியையுடைய இக்கூதிர் காலத்துத் துன்பத்தைத் தீர்க்கும் மருந்து, அவர் தழுவிய மார்பைத் தவிர வேறு ஒன்றும் இல்லை.","explanation":"In this poem, the heroine (talaivi) speaks to her companion (tōḻi) about her suffering during the cold early winter season (arciram) in the absence of her lover. She describes a vivid scene from nature where herds of deer graze on the dark, ripe pods of the red-stemmed black gram, which resemble the reddish legs of a quail. This imagery of deer feeding together highlights the warmth of companionship in nature, contrasting sharply with her own loneliness. The biting cold of the winter represents the emotional chill of separation. She concludes that the only 'medicine' (maruntu) capable of curing this deep physical and emotional cold is the warm embrace of her lover's chest.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.74],[0.74,0.86],[1.1,1.4],[1.4,1.5],[1.5,1.73],[1.96,2.88],[3.34,3.8],[3.8,4.3],[4.3,4.3],[4.3,4.4],[4.4,6.3],[6.3,7.36],[7.36,7.9],[7.9,8.3],[8.3,8.4]],"female":[[0.0,0.65],[0.65,1.1],[1.1,1.6],[1.6,1.8],[2.17,3.4],[3.9,4.0],[4.0,4.0],[4.0,4.5],[4.5,5.3],[5.3,5.5],[5.5,6.3],[6.3,7.4],[7.4,8.0],[8.0,8.4],[8.4,8.5]]},"sync":[[["பூழ்க்கால்","quail's leg"]],[["பூழ்க்கால்","quail's leg"],["அன்ன","like"]],[["செங்கால்","red stem"]],[["உழுந்தின்","of black gram"]],[["ஊழ்ப்படு","ripened"]],[["முதுகாய்","mature pod"]],[["உழையினம்","herd of deer"]],[["கவரும்","which eats"]],[["அரும்பனி","harsh cold"]],[["அற்சிரம்","early winter season"]],[["தீர்க்கும்","which cures"]],[["மருந்து","medicine"],["பிறிது","other"]],[["பிறிது","other"],["இல்லை","is not"],["அவர்","he"]],[["மணந்த","embraced"]],[["மார்பே","chest indeed"]]]}